{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Dominate the Skies, the only way to rise through the ranks is sheer skill and unshakable nerve. Step into the cockpit and test your mettle in this high-octane demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free demo features three core modes, each giving you a taste of the chaos and thrill waiting in the full game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race \u2013 Blaze through high-speed aerial tracks built for risk-takers. Nail tight corners, dodge, and fight for your place on the leaderboard.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assault \u2013 Engage in explosive combat scenarios. Master your weapons, crush enemy bots, and stay alive under relentless fire.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freefly \u2013 No timers, no enemies, just you and the open skies. Roam freely or hone your piloting skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pick from a lineup of pre-built AGVs and exo-suits.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version of Dominate the Skies will feature <strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong> gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sky\u2019s calling, Skybender!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*<strong>The demo is single-player only.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687520?t=1745813450","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687520/724b7e2243aba8fccf089f61a6f005f95607b93a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745813450","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687520/8162f17d9277aa17a16649701178b35413eabf9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745813450","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687520/8162f17d9277aa17a16649701178b35413eabf9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745813450","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Dominate the Skies, the only way to rise through the ranks is sheer skill and unshakable nerve. Step into the cockpit and test your mettle in this high-octane demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free demo features three core modes, each giving you a taste of the chaos and thrill waiting in the full game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race \u2013 Blaze through high-speed aerial tracks built for risk-takers. Nail tight corners, dodge, and fight for your place on the leaderboard.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assault \u2013 Engage in explosive combat scenarios. Master your weapons, crush enemy bots, and stay alive under relentless fire.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freefly \u2013 No timers, no enemies, just you and the open skies. Roam freely or hone your piloting skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pick from a lineup of pre-built AGVs and exo-suits.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version of Dominate the Skies will feature <strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong> gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sky\u2019s calling, Skybender!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*<strong>The demo is single-player only.</strong></p>","developers":["Blue Squirrel Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3478260","name":"Dominate the Skies"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass